      "answer": "D",
      "note": "D Ta có \\[y' = \\frac{1}{{2\\sqrt x }} + 1\\]\\[ \\Rightarrow y'\\left( 4 \\right) = \\frac{1}{{2\\sqrt 4 }} + 1 = \\frac{5}{4}.\\]"
